# Markdown is prose, not code.
*.md

# JSON is written by scripts with JSON.stringify(value, null, 2) and compared byte for byte (`pnpm openapi:import
# --all --check`, `pnpm catalog:conformance` spec hashes, `pnpm evidence:check`, proof inputs). Prettier would fold
# short arrays onto one line, so every such check would see drift.
*.json
*.jsonc

